    <Comments>Very faint, stylised handwriting; many letter forms uncertain, so the readings (especially names such as Stettin, Lunzlau, Weidhof, Lehmann and the word Kräge) are best guesses and should be checked against the image. Superscript/umlaut marks could not be reliably distinguished.; script=kurrent</Comments>
